TC08 Backplane
<UL>
<LI><b>indicators</b> is an LED version of the TC08 Indicator panel.</LI>
<LI><b>so-indicators</b> is a surface mount version of the indicators
board.</LI>
<LI><b>so-indicators-ok</b> is a backup of so-indicators.</LI>
<LI><b>tc08nh</b> is a successful routing without screw holes.</LI>
<LI><b>tc08</b> is a drawing of DEC's TC08 DECtape Controller.</LI>
<LI><b>tc08-6u</b> is a drawing of DEC's TC08 DECtape Controller, drawn to fit in 6Uin a DEC rack.</LI>
<LI><b>tc08-8-07</b> is an 8/2007 checkpoint of the TC08 drawing.</LI>
